  "distribution": "Algorithm-oriented default no_clues implementation.",
  "configuration_provenance": "Role models and method budgets adapted from the finalized no_clues experiment configuration associated with the pinned method source.",
  "changes": [
    "Presented compilation and research-to-reading directly in pipeline.py.",
    "Extracted the default six-view ranking, source-pinned context and reader path from the research scripts.",
    "Moved role prompts into plain-text resources with their original contents.",
    "Removed run locks, runtime hash gates, disk checkpoints, resumption, transport caches, automatic retries and per-request receipts.",
    "Removed inactive experimental branches and unused runtime modules.",
    "Retained fact provenance, visible-source filtering, retrieval budgets and failed-row scoring semantics.",
    "Replaced private deployment details with explicit environment configuration."
  ],
  "execution": "Fresh sequential passes with direct model requests. Question-level failures produce a failed scoring row.",
